{"schemaVersion":2,"release":"pilot-40-0","kind":"dictionary-translations","data":{"v:00258109":{"examples":{"The container leaked gasoline":"容器漏出了汽油。","the roof leaks badly":"屋顶漏得很厉害。"}},"n:05803379":{"examples":{"an estimate of what it would cost":"对所需费用的估计"}},"n:03290771":{"examples":{"they waited at the entrance to the garden":"他们在花园入口等候。"}},"v:02133435":{"examples":{"She seems to be sleeping":"她似乎正在睡觉。","This appears to be a very difficult problem":"这看起来是一个非常困难的问题。","This project looks fishy":"这个项目看起来有些可疑。","They appeared like people who had not eaten or slept for a long time":"他们看起来像很久没有吃饭或睡觉的人。"}},"n:08615638":{"examples":{}},"a:02847786":{"examples":{"floral organs":"花的器官。"}},"a:00903668":{"examples":{"foods indispensable to good nutrition":"获得良好营养不可缺少的食物。"}},"a:00685638":{"examples":{"an able and decisive young woman":"一位能干而果断的年轻女性。","we needed decisive leadership":"我们需要果断的领导。","she gave him a decisive answer":"她给了他一个坚决的答复。"}},"n:00266401":{"examples":{"the market took a downturn":"市场出现下滑。"}},"n:06390962":{"examples":{"a preliminary draft":"初步草稿","the final draft of the constitution":"宪法的最终草案"}},"s:01917594":{"examples":{"there was something fishy about the accident":"这起事故有些蹊跷。","up to some funny business":"在搞一些可疑的勾当","some definitely queer goings-on":"一些明显古怪的事情","a shady deal":"一桩不光明正大的交易","her motives were suspect":"她的动机值得怀疑。","suspicious behavior":"可疑的行为"}}},"resources":[]}
